{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.37:1.1", "PA_thag_2.37:1.2"], "en": "“The night, garlanded with stars, is not yet time for sleep;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.37:1.3", "PA_thag_2.37:1.4"], "en": "“This very night must be kept watch over by one who understands. [He saw:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
